SUMMARY:Moon Hollow
LOCATION:Dreamaway Lodge\, 1342 County Rd\, Becket\, MA 01223
DESCRIPTION:"Moon Hollow is an acoustic quartet based in Western Massachuse
 tts that performs original & traditional tunes inspired by folk\, american
 a\, bluegrass & early jazz music including catchy originals and tight thre
 e part harmonies. Some notable acts they have shared the stage with includ
 e Ryan Montbleau\, The Mallet Brothers\, Chris Pureka\, Clay Pigeons\, Tig
 erman Woah\, DiTrani Brothers\, Jatoba\, Folkfaces\, Blind Owl Band\, Bell
 a's Bartok\, etc. Formed in 2019 in Brattleboro\, VT - now based in wester
 n mass. They perform over 100 shows a year around the valley and New Engla
 nd."\nhttps://www.thedreamawaylodge.com/music/moon-hollow-jpk73\nFrom Push
 pin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thedreamawaylodge.com/music/moon-hollow-jpk73
